{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16819","headline":"享文恭太子庙乐章 · 陈京","name":"享文恭太子庙乐章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"歌以德发，声以乐贵。\n乐善名存，追仙礼异。\n鸾旌拱修，凤鸣合次。\n神听皇慈，仲月皆至。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈京","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16819.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16819","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}